      "notes": "V12 (released 2026-06-30; 3,574,646 parcels; next release V13 tentatively 2027-06-30). Full statewide file geodatabase is 515,810,191 bytes compressed (web.s3.wisc.edu, Last-Modified 2026-06-30) and needs GDAL/ArcGIS, so the config archives JSON pages from the public ArcGIS REST feature service (maxRecordCount 2000, ordered by OBJECTID) filtered to PROPCLASS containing 2 (commercial) or 3 (manufacturing): this config lists the 9 pages for CONAME='MILWAUKEE' (16,582 parcels; 280,676 in the county). The same query with another CONAME gives any other county (statewide 185,994 commercial or manufacturing parcels). Owner names are present except Kenosha County (100% redacted, 'NOT AVAILABLE') and partial redaction in 8 counties (Dane 11.43%). Wisconsin has no multifamily property class: apartments are class 2 (commercial). robots.txt: sco.wisc.edu allows all but /wp-admin/; web.s3.wisc.edu has none (NoSuchBucket 404); the ArcGIS Online services host publishes none."
